            "answer": "<p>For humidity, the answer is 2205 marine-grade stainless steel on every spigot, connector, hinge and latch, with a 10-year no-rust promise. Hurricane season runs June through November. The railing is tempered safety glass, not a storm shutter; treat it like your other exterior glass when a storm is forecast. If your building department asks about attachment, our engineering documents cover top-mount and side-mount spigots on wood and concrete.</p>",
